面那个，是他带来的朋友，叫做蒋衍。”温浩雪向众姐妹们进行现场直播解说。由于蒋衍长得比莫文洋更帅气，所有人一拥而上。一个钟头后，所有的人咬牙切齿、嘟着嘴巴、灰头丧脸地退了回来。“得瑟什么？不就是个破落户！”“他今天来我们这里穿的这套衣服，还是他朋友借给他的。”“没有钱，只有帅屁用。”“别说房子和车，照他不稳定的工作和工资，不是公务员，要养家糊口都难。”温蔓后来想，如果蒋衍不是破落户，她大概连看都不会看他一眼。主要是他能把她一群姐妹们、姨妈、婶婶气成这样，足以让她另眼相看了。离开手上的书页，从阴影里伸出点脖子，温蔓隔着大眼镜的目光小心地落在破落户王子那里。身高应该有一米八以上，银条纹衬衣，蓝黑西裤，擦得程亮的皮鞋，衬衣最顶上的扣子拨开了一颗，露出小截优美的锁骨。五官眉清目秀，鼻梁英挺，眉梢里带了一抹倨傲，唇角边带了一抹冷肃。不小心的，两人眼珠子碰了一下。温蔓的头立马耷拉下去，眼睛对向腿上摊开的书本。因着客厅里嘈杂的声音愈来愈大，她是把凳子挪到了阳台图清净。没想到阳台的落地窗户哗地推开，一个身影闪到了她旁边。温蔓柔美的眉尖小簇，小抬起的眼角能见到那个破落户倚在阳台的栏杆上，像是吹风应景似地叹了句：“这景色是很美，但风大了点，肚子都饿了。”咕噜噜，饥肠辘辘的声音，从这个长得英俊帅气的男人身上发出来。破落户，还真的是破落户，被温家一家人说中了，只有帅没有用处。问题是，温蔓听着这声音，自己因为被母亲的急令没能来得及吃上晚饭，饿到现在也快撑不住了。把头小心地往客厅里探视，温家里的每个人都在为能攀上这门亲事使尽浑身解数，这时候如果自己喊饿，不止煞风景，必定会被许玉娥再骂一顿丢脸。算了，算了。温蔓轻手轻脚搁了书本，站起，准备偷偷溜出门给自己找吃的。然而，那个破落户居然回了头，盯向了她。一双糅杂了各种颜色的眼睛，把温蔓的脊梁骨看得有些发毛：这人明显饿得快不行了，而且有些怨气的，可能是被拉来温家时想着能被请吃上一餐，结果没有吃上免费饭食，还得饿肚子。“如果你不介意吃泡面的话——”温蔓再小心不过地打开唇口，一边注意客厅里的情况。不过，这破落户是破落户，可是这么傲气，能接受吃泡面的建议吗？挺拔的身影快速一闪，捉住了她的一只手，捣蒜似地点头：“没有问题。只要是能吃的。”这可怜的人，不是连泡面都吃不起吧。温蔓不知如何形容心头一时这种复杂的感觉：同病相怜？趁着客厅里的人统统移驾到了书房，要看莫文洋表演书法。温蔓带着破落户蹑手蹑脚走到了门口，打开门，两人顺利地溜了出去。屋外，如他说的，夜景美好，一轮月光照射在小区的路上，打着两人的影子。风略大了些，能听见小区里的绿植沙沙沙地作响，显得地处幽静。走到路口的拐角，便有一家小卖部。温蔓摸了摸牛仔裤裤袋里，刚好有给温媛买画笔后找零的十几块钱，便与小卖部老板商量：“要两个康师傅牛肉面碗，能帮我们冲上热水吗？面料我们自己放。对了，我还要一包榨菜。”小卖部老板收了钱，按照她的叮嘱，帮她把东西都准备好。于是温蔓开始拆开面碗的包装，给两个面碗放料。在别人的眼里，她这个放料的方式有点儿怪，不是按照说明书把全部材料一块放了后泡上热水。小卖部老板和蒋衍看着她一双小手在两个面碗上面忙个不停，都感到惊异：吃个泡面需要这么麻烦吗？“好了。”在几分钟后，温蔓一双月牙儿眼满意地笑开。蒋衍接过她递来的面碗时，在她那双笑起来像月牙儿的眼睛停顿了会儿，俊朗的面孔仿佛闪过了一丝怔。“我们坐到那边开饭吧。别阻碍人家做生意。”温蔓只顾低着头，捧着自己的面碗坐到了街道两边的石墩上。蒋衍两条修长的腿一迈，几步便坐到了她身边，学着她掀开了面碗上那层封盖。迎面扑来的香气，像是寻常方便面的味道，又夹杂了一丝更引人胃口的感觉。低头看，面碗上漂浮的面条与菜干，看起来浸泡的程度刚刚好，也不见有浮油。把塑料叉子在面里头搅了搅，捞起来吸进嘴里，双目愣是一怔：好吃！这样泡得刚刚好的方便面和菜干，不是一般人能做出来的。温蔓在旁边慢条斯理地吃着，斯文的程度达到，没有发出一丁点吃面条的声音。蒋衍肚子是很饿，这面条真的很好吃，举起面碗咕噜噜，一口气把面碗里的汤都喝得见底了。吃得干干净净后自己也有些怔：从不知道方便面能这么好吃的。温蔓只吃了半碗，从上衣袋子里摸出了包纸巾，抽出一张给他。蒋衍叠了叠纸巾后拿来慢慢地擦拭嘴角，迟疑了一下后才问：“你，是经常吃泡面吗？”她泡方便面和吃泡面的功夫上乘一流，应该是经过许久的锻炼。一般的人，大概都会这么想吧。温蔓愣了下后，感到好笑似地笑了笑：“怎么可能？”蒋衍见着她笑，这回没有怔，看着她的眼睛里浮现了丝复杂的沉意：“你——很好。”温蔓更愣了：“哎？”“你家里人都知道我的处境，只有你愿意请我吃东西。”蒋衍说出这话时，俊脸上可没有一点儿为自己的穷酸感到羞愧的。温蔓眨了眨微翘的眼睫毛：这破落户还真是非比寻常的傲气。", "source": "www.quanwenyuedu.io", "source_url": "https://www.quanwenyuedu.io/n/dahunwanchen/2.html", "_fixed": true, "content_en": "002 Only Handsome Broken Settlement \"The one walking in the front, polite and pleasant-looking, is the son of my father's colleague, named Mo Wenyang. The one in the back is the friend he brought, named Jiang Yan.\" Wen Haoxue explained to the sisters live. Because Jiang Yan was more handsome than Mo Wenyang, everyone flocked to him. An hour later, everyone gnashed their teeth, pouted, and retreated in despair. \"What are you talking about? He's just a poor man!\" \"The clothes he wore when he came to us today were lent to him by his friend.\" \"No money, just a handsome guy.\" \"Don't talk about the house and car. With his unstable job and salary, it would be difficult for him to support his family if he was not a civil servant.\" Wen Man later thought that if Jiang Yan was not a poor man, she probably wouldn't even look at him. Mainly because he could make her group of sisters, aunts and uncles so angry, it was enough to make her look at him differently. Leaving the page in her hand and stretching out her neck from the shadows, Wen Man looked carefully at the prince of the poor family through her big glasses. He should be over 1.8 meters tall, wearing a silver striped shirt, blue and black trousers, and polished leather shoes. The top button of his shirt was unbuttoned, revealing a small and graceful collarbone. The facial features are delicate, the bridge of the nose is straight, there is a touch of arrogance in the eyebrows, and there is a touch of coldness in the corners of the lips. Inadvertently, their eyes touched. Wen Man's head immediately drooped, eyes looking at the book spread out on his lap. As the noise in the living room became louder and louder, she moved her stool to the balcony to keep it quiet. Unexpectedly, the floor-to-ceiling windows of the balcony opened with a crash, and a figure flashed next to her. With her gentle and soft brows, from the corner of her raised eyes, she could see the shabby man leaning on the railing of the balcony, sighing as if the wind was blowing to suit the scene: \"This scenery is beautiful, but the wind is too strong, and I'm getting hungry.\" Gurgling, hungry sounds came from this handsome and handsome man. The Wen family was right when they said that he was handsome and useless. The problem is, when Wen Man heard this voice, she didn't have time to eat dinner because of her mother's urgent order, and she was so hungry that she could hardly hold on anymore. He cautiously looked into the living room. Everyone in the Wen family was trying their best to get married. If he complained about hunger at this time, he would not only ruin the scenery, but would definitely be scolded and embarrassed by Xu Yu'e again. Forget it, forget it. Wen Man put the book down gently, stood up, and prepared to sneak out to find something to eat for herself. However, the poor man actually turned around and stared at her. A pair of eyes with a mixture of colors made Wen Man's spine feel hairy: this man was obviously very hungry, and he was a little resentful. He might have been brought to Wen's house thinking he could be treated to a meal, but in the end he didn't get free meals and had to go hungry. \"If you don't mind eating instant noodles-\" Wen Man opened her lips very carefully while paying attention to the situation in the living room. However, this is a broken household, but he is so arrogant, can he accept the suggestion of eating instant noodles? The tall and tall figure flashed quickly, grabbed one of her hands, and nodded like a fool: \"No problem. As long as it is edible.\" This poor man couldn't even afford instant noodles. Wen Man didn't know how to describe the complicated feeling in her heart: We feel sorry for each other? While everyone in the living room moved to the study, they wanted to watch Mo Wenyang perform calligraphy. Wen Man tiptoed to the door with Po Luhu, opened the door, and the two of them slipped out smoothly. Outside the house, as he said, the night view was beautiful, with a round of moonlight shining on the road in the community, casting the shadows of the two of them. The wind is a little stronger, and you can hear the green plants in the community rustling, making it appear to be a quiet place. When you reach the corner of the intersection, there is a small shop. Wen Man touched the pocket of his jeans and found just a dozen yuan in change after buying a paintbrush for Wen Yuan, so he discussed with the canteen owner: \"We need two Master Kong beef noodle bowls. Can you help us make hot water? We put the fabric ourselves. By the way, I also want a pack of mustard.\" The canteen owner accepted the money and followed her instructions to help her prepare everything. So Wen Man began to unpack the noodle bowls and put ingredients into the two noodle bowls. In the eyes of others, her way of putting the ingredients was a bit strange. She did not put all the ingredients together according to the instructions and soak them in hot water. The canteen owner and Jiang Yan looked at her small hands busy with the two noodle bowls and were surprised: Does eating instant noodles need to be so troublesome? \"Okay.\" After a few minutes, Wen Man smiled with satisfaction with her crescent eyes. When Jiang Yan took the noodle bowl from her, her eyes that looked like crescent moons when she smiled paused for a moment, and a trace of confusion seemed to flash across her handsome face. \"Let's sit over there and have dinner. Don't hinder other people's business.\" Wen Man just lowered his head, holding his noodle bowl and sitting on the stone piers on both sides of the street. Jiang Yan stepped forward with his slender legs and sat next to her in a few steps, imitating her to lift the cover on the noodle bowl. The aroma that hits you is like the smell of ordinary instant noodles, mixed with a slightly more appetizing feeling. Looking down, the noodles and dried vegetables floating on the noodle bowl seemed to have been soaked just right, and there was no oil slick. He stirred the noodles with a plastic fork, picked them up and sucked them into his mouth. His eyes were stunned: delicious! Such perfectly soaked instant noodles and dried vegetables are not something ordinary people can make. Wen Man was eating slowly and politely beside him, without making the slightest sound of eating noodles. Jiang Yan was very hungry. The noodles were really delicious. He raised the noodle bowl and drank all the soup in one go. After eating everything, I was a little startled: I never knew instant noodles could be so delicious. Wen Man only ate half the bowl, took out a pack of tissues from his coat pocket, and took one out to him. Jiang Yan folded a bunch of paper towels and took it", "title_en": "Chapter 2"}